    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d476">

                <pb facs="0712" n="698" sameAs="frus:frus1947v05/pg698"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">880.00/6–2047: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Embassy in France </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">top secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1947-07-11T17:00:00-04:00">July 11, 1947—5 p.
                            m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2556. We have carefully studied and are in full accord with both findings and
                    recommendations contained urtel 2442<anchor n="1" xml:id="d476-f1"/> and urdesp
                    9033 June 20.</p>
                <p>We believe present time is propitious and therefore you should make recommended
                    oral approach at highest level. If you have any strong reasons for not acting
                    immediately please inform Dept.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Marshall</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
